Competition originality statement:

This project is an AI agent demo developed by Nanshan von Neumann Team for
the student job matching scenario. Its core features include resume parsing,
job recommendation, JD analysis, matching explanation, resume optimization,
mock interview, and an AI job-seeking assistant.

The repository is made public for this competition submission, review,
reproduction, and learning reference. The original source, Apache License 2.0
text, and author/team attribution should be retained for competition review,
public demonstration, redistribution, or modified versions.
